description = "It takes ×12 the damage of the Warden that triggered it, and lightning arcs to up to 8 nightmares with {damp} within 2.5 cells for ×6, adding 1 {static} to each. Triggered by {stacks:need_damp} {damp} + {stacks:clap_static} {static} ({stacks:bossclap_static} on bosses). Uses up the {static}."
